    "provenance": "V008 user annotated IMG_9112/IMG_9114: side relief moved to front Y0..20 Z60..80 while rear spine stays intact. Two independently adjustable, vertical symmetric rail/support-arm X pitches. M3 x 6-8 fasteners; parametric counterbore/head, floor wall and radial wall. Slimmer rails and rear contour. Actual PCB and connector geometry unmeasured. V009 corrects through-thickness port relief notches that crossed the M3 screw centerlines; retain a continuous central rail spine and integrated screw-bearing pads, with rear-open counterbores. V009 structural correction: no separate carrier. Both arms directly carry the M3 head seats, \u00d83.4 through-bores, and rear \u00d87 tool corridors; remaining front seat wall 3.2 mm. Provisional stations S=20/65 avoid front opening while measured PCB pattern remains unknown. V010: nominal \u00d812 front neck around \u00d87 rear driver access, X width tapered into the full structural arm; top excess trimmed to 9.5 mm above upper M3; analytic tangent arcs on the structural outer profile and a 1 mm keeper vertical-edge fillet. Critical bores, mating planes, source rail geometry and floor unchanged; print strength remains unqualified. V011: screw stations determine side opening top/bottom, rear opening contour, and exterior shoulder/bulge height. A full \u00d87 tool-path plus 4 mm web envelope drives key planes; roof and lower web are checked against tangentially filleted cuts; no independent fixed Z opening. V012: one filleted U-cutter instead of joined slot2D + rectangle; smoothstep-like lofted front neck root; source-STEP-extracted four-hole datum independently tracked because provisional 78x45 mounting pattern does not physically match 114x59.1 reference. V013: enlarge both arm U windows using screw station \u00b110 mm, radiused R6 corners, and deeper rear boundary at Y45/Y36 while preserving 8 mm nominal slope spine. All four \u00d87 longitudinal driver tunnels are explicitly extended beyond the actual arm rear envelope; M3 seats remain blind with \u22653.2 mm axial bearing floor and screw clearance passages into screen only. Source Waveshare 114\u00d759.1 mm remains a separate unregistered datum.",
